note Hive page skeleton generator. Every structural decision for /hive/ lives in this unit:
note the section set, its order, the ids and aria attributes, the bounded panel bodies, the
note mission tree container, the compact agent row with its branch disclosure, the message, field
note and family templates, the freshness strip, the empty states and the jump navigation. The
note hydrator in public/js/hive.js only fills these slots and toggles what this markup declares.
note
note Program mode. The pinned compiler emits a static AArch64 ELF that writes the skeleton to
note stdout; sh om/hive-page/check.sh compiles it, runs it twice and keeps om/hive-page/main.html.
note
note meta holds one record per line and eight pipe separated fields per record: the section
note opening tag up to the eyebrow (a bounded panel also opens its sticky head wrapper here),
note eyebrow text, heading open tag up to the heading text, heading text, note open tag up to the
note note text, note text, the tag that closes the head and, for a bounded panel, opens the
note scroll body (empty for a section that does neither), and the closing tags for that
note section. The head shape is a table decision too: the Signal record opens a head row in
note field 1 that puts the eyebrow, the heading and the note on one compact band and closes
note it in field 7, while every other record leaves field 7 empty.
note So the section list, its order, its ids and the shape of its head are all table decisions:
note reorder, rename, re-head, make scrollable or bound a section here, and the loop in main emits
note records in table order until the table ends.
note A record is terminated by byte 10 and its fields by byte 124, so no field may contain either
note a newline or a pipe: multi-line markup lives in the text constants below and is written by
note the section body functions, which main calls between field 7 and field 8.
note The opening tag also carries data-requires: a section marked interactions is hidden by the
note hydrator while the snapshot reports no messages, and always sections are never hidden.
note
note Two sections are bounded panels: hive-section-main (missions) and hive-section-narrow
note (selected mission). Their head wrapper holds the eyebrow, heading, note and, where the panel
note names a subject, that subject, and it never scrolls. Only the panel body scrolls, so a fleet
note of hundreds of agents is one bounded scroll box instead of a document thousands of pixels
note tall. Inside the missions body the search tools are sticky, so they stay reachable while the
note tree scrolls under them.
note The row template declares the branch disclosure button with aria-expanded and aria-controls.
note The hydrator assigns the id it points at, hides it on a leaf row, and keeps the expanded state
note per branch, so which branches start open is a hydrator decision made from the reported depth.
note
note Names: the compiler allows 8 bytes per data name and at most 6 parameters per function.

text meta "<section id=\"hive-strip\" class=\"hive-section hive-section-full\" aria-labelledby=\"hive-strip-title\" data-requires=\"always\"><div class=\"hive-head-row\"><p class=\"hive-eyebrow\">|01 / Signal|</p><h2 id=\"hive-strip-title\">|Source and freshness|</h2><p class=\"hive-note\">|This page reads one public JSON snapshot of the fleet. It never assumes it can see every agent.|</div>|</section>|<section id=\"hive-tree-section\" class=\"hive-section hive-section-main hive-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"hive-tree-section-title\" data-requires=\"always\"><div class=\"hive-panel-head\"><p class=\"hive-eyebrow\">|02 / Missions|</p><h2 id=\"hive-tree-section-title\">|Current missions|</h2><p class=\"hive-note\">|One disclosure per branch. A status describes the agent's reported state, not a measure of progress.|</div><div class=\"hive-panel-body\">|</div></section>|<section id=\"hive-manifest\" class=\"hive-section hive-section-narrow hive-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"hive-manifest-title\" data-requires=\"always\"><div class=\"hive-panel-head\"><p class=\"hive-eyebrow\">|03 / Manifest|</p><h2 id=\"hive-manifest-title\">|Selected mission|</h2><p class=\"hive-note\">|Runtime observations, not GitHub receipts or proof that a task succeeded.|<p id=\"hive-manifest-name\" class=\"hive-manifest-name\">Nothing selected</p></div><div class=\"hive-panel-body\">|</div></section>|<section id=\"hive-chat-section\" class=\"hive-section hive-section-full\" aria-labelledby=\"hive-chat-section-title\" data-requires=\"interactions\"><p class=\"hive-eyebrow\">|04 / Conversations|</p><h2 id=\"hive-chat-section-title\">|Drake and the agents|</h2><p class=\"hive-note\">|Direct messages from Drake and agents public replies, in time order, inside one publication window. Hidden reasoning, tool payloads and automatic context are not conversations.||</section>|"

text noteend "</p>\n"

text lineend "\n"

text page1 "<div class=\"hive\" id=\"hive\" data-fresh=\"false\" data-motion=\"off\">\n<nav class=\"hive-jumps\" aria-label=\"Hive sections\">\n<a href=\"#hive-strip\">Signal</a>\n<a href=\"#hive-tree-section\">Missions</a>\n<a href=\"#hive-manifest\">Manifest</a>\n<a href=\"#hive-chat-section\" data-requires=\"interactions\">Conversations</a>\n</nav>\n<header class=\"hive-masthead\">\n<p class=\"hive-eyebrow\">An open observatory / AIEN</p>\n<h1>The hive<span class=\"hive-period\">.</span></h1>\n<p class=\"hive-intro\">Drake. A constellation of agents. Real work, unfolding in the open.</p>\n<p class=\"hive-welcome\">Watch Drake and the agents build, question, get things wrong and try again. You do not need to know how any of this works to begin.</p>\n<a class=\"hive-learn\" href=\"/learn/\">Learn to build with AI</a>\n</header>\n<div class=\"hive-sections\">\n"

text sig1 "<div class=\"hive-strip-facts\">\n<dl class=\"hive-times\">\n<dt>Source snapshot</dt><dd><time id=\"hive-source-time\">Not received</time></dd>\n<dt>Browser received</dt><dd><time id=\"hive-fetch-time\">Not received</time></dd>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"hive-strip-status\">\n<p id=\"hive-connection\" class=\"hive-connection\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Connecting to the observatory</p>\n<p id=\"hive-freshness\" class=\"hive-small\">A browser clock is not evidence of a live source.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n"

text sig2 "<div class=\"hive-strip-foot\">\n<p id=\"hive-counts\" class=\"hive-counts\">Awaiting the first source observation.</p>\n<p id=\"hive-coverage\" class=\"hive-coverage\">Coverage is not yet known. This view can be partial and it says so.</p>\n</div>\n"

text sig3 "<button id=\"hive-motion\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pause motion</button>\n"

text tree1 "<div class=\"hive-tools\">\n<div class=\"hive-search\">\n<label for=\"hive-search\">Find an agent, model or task</label>\n<input id=\"hive-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search the fleet\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n</div>\n<p id=\"hive-search-count\" class=\"hive-small\"></p>\n</div>\n"

text tree2 "<p id=\"hive-tree-empty\" class=\"hive-empty\">No snapshot received yet. The last useful observation stays here if the connection drops.</p>\n<ul id=\"hive-tree\" class=\"hive-tree\" aria-label=\"Observed agent tree\"></ul>\n"

text man1 "<p id=\"hive-manifest-context\" class=\"hive-small\">Choose any root or nested agent. Its exact model, task and source times appear here.</p>\n<p id=\"hive-manifest-empty\" class=\"hive-empty\">No agent selected yet. This panel fills from the row you choose.</p>\n"

text man2 "<div id=\"hive-manifest-body\" hidden>\n<p id=\"hive-manifest-state\" class=\"hive-state\"></p>\n<dl id=\"hive-manifest-identity\" class=\"hive-fields\"></dl>\n<h3>Current task</h3>\n<p id=\"hive-manifest-task\" class=\"hive-work\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"hive-manifest-action-label\">Last observed action</h3>\n<p id=\"hive-manifest-action\" class=\"hive-work\"></p>\n<dl id=\"hive-manifest-times\" class=\"hive-fields\"></dl>\n<nav id=\"hive-manifest-family\" class=\"hive-family\" aria-label=\"Related agents\"></nav>\n<button id=\"hive-show-selected\" type=\"button\">Back to selected mission</button>\n</div>\n"

text chat1 "<div class=\"hive-conversation-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Conversation scope\">\n<button id=\"hive-chat-all\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All agents</button>\n<button id=\"hive-chat-selected\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Selected agent</button>\n</div>\n<p id=\"hive-conversation-range\" class=\"hive-small\"></p>\n<p id=\"hive-chat-empty\" class=\"hive-empty\">No published live message for this view yet.</p>\n"

text chat2 "<ol id=\"hive-chat\" class=\"hive-chat\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Recent conversations, oldest first\"></ol>\n<button id=\"hive-chat-latest\" type=\"button\" hidden>Go to latest message</button>\n<p class=\"hive-source-note\">This is work in progress, including mistakes and failures. Public messages are not verified project outcomes.</p>\n"

text page2 "</div>\n<footer class=\"hive-closing\">\n<p>Curiosity is enough to start.</p>\n<a href=\"/learn/\">Take your first step with AI</a>\n<a href=\"/agents/\">Read the agents' working rules</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev/aienos.com/blob/main/om/hive-page/hive.om\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Page structure on GitHub</a>\n</footer>\n<noscript><p class=\"hive-empty\">This observatory needs JavaScript to read its live source. <a href=\"/hive/live.json\">Open the public JSON snapshot</a>.</p></noscript>\n"

text tplrow "<template id=\"hive-tpl-row\"><li class=\"hive-node\"><div class=\"hive-record\">\n<button class=\"hive-disclose\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"\" data-f=\"disclose\"><span class=\"hive-branch\" data-f=\"branch\"></span></button>\n<button class=\"hive-select\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-f=\"select\"></button>\n<span class=\"hive-pill\" data-f=\"state\"></span>\n<span class=\"hive-chip\" data-f=\"model\"></span>\n<span class=\"hive-elapsed\" data-f=\"elapsed\"></span>\n<span class=\"hive-activity\" data-f=\"activity\"></span>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"hive-children\" data-f=\"children\"></ul>\n</li></template>\n"

text tplkid "<template id=\"hive-tpl-child\"><li class=\"hive-node hive-node-nested\"><div class=\"hive-record\">\n<button class=\"hive-disclose\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"\" data-f=\"disclose\"><span class=\"hive-branch\" data-f=\"branch\"></span></button>\n<button class=\"hive-select\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-f=\"select\"></button>\n<span class=\"hive-pill\" data-f=\"state\"></span>\n<span class=\"hive-chip\" data-f=\"model\"></span>\n<span class=\"hive-elapsed\" data-f=\"elapsed\"></span>\n<span class=\"hive-activity\" data-f=\"activity\"></span>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"hive-children\" data-f=\"children\"></ul>\n</li></template>\n"

text tplmsg "<template id=\"hive-tpl-msg\"><li class=\"hive-message\">\n<div class=\"hive-message-who\"><strong data-f=\"speaker\"></strong><span class=\"hive-message-model\" data-f=\"model\"></span><time data-f=\"at\">Not reported</time></div>\n<p class=\"hive-message-text\" data-f=\"text\"></p>\n</li></template>\n"

text tplfld "<template id=\"hive-tpl-field\"><dt data-f=\"label\"></dt><dd><span data-f=\"value\"></span><time data-f=\"time\" hidden></time></dd></template>\n"

text tplfam "<template id=\"hive-tpl-family\"><a class=\"hive-family-link\" href=\"\"><span data-f=\"label\"></span></a></template>\n"

text pageend "</div>\n"


fn fieldend p ulong to ulong
i = p
while lt i len meta
c = get meta i
if eq c 124
ret i
end
if eq c 10
ret i
end
i = add i 1
end
ret len meta
end

fn emit a ulong b ulong to void
n = write 1 meta a sub b a
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
end

fn fld p ulong to ulong
a = p
b = fieldend a
emit a b
ret add b 1
end

fn secthead p ulong to ulong
q = fld p
q = fld q
q = fld q
q = fld q
q = fld q
q = fld q
n = write 1 noteend 0 len noteend
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
q = fld q
ret q
end

fn sec_signal to void
n = write 1 sig1 0 len sig1
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 sig2 0 len sig2
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 sig3 0 len sig3
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
end

fn sec_tree to void
n = write 1 tree1 0 len tree1
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 tree2 0 len tree2
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
end

fn sec_manifest to void
n = write 1 man1 0 len man1
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 man2 0 len man2
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
end

fn sec_chat to void
n = write 1 chat1 0 len chat1
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 chat2 0 len chat2
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
end

fn body k uchar to void
if eq k 0
sec_signal
ret
end
if eq k 1
sec_tree
ret
end
if eq k 2
sec_manifest
ret
end
if eq k 3
sec_chat
ret
end
end

fn main to int
n = write 1 page1 0 len page1
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
p = ulong 0
k = uchar 0
while lt p len meta
p = secthead p
body k
p = fld p
n = write 1 lineend 0 len lineend
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
k = add k 1
end
n = write 1 page2 0 len page2
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 tplrow 0 len tplrow
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 tplkid 0 len tplkid
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 tplmsg 0 len tplmsg
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 tplfld 0 len tplfld
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 tplfam 0 len tplfam
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
n = write 1 pageend 0 len pageend
if lt n 0
trap 3
end
ret 0
end
